    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid flood fill</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Component labels</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/making-a-large-island/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 827</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Making A Large Island</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Paint every island with its own id and remember its area. Then flipping a 0 creates an island of 1 + the areas of the DISTINCT ids around it. Two linear passes: O(n<sup>2</sup>) time and space, instead of re-flooding the grid for every 0.</p>\n"
